    "title": "Inter&Co: Financial APP",
    "description": "Your new financial super app is here. Download the Inter&Co super app and open your zero-fee digital account today. Take control of your finances the modern way.  \r\n\r\nGet access to a range of services and benefits directly on your app. Send money abroad to over 60 countries. Invest in stocks and ETFs from as little as $5. Deposit your checks and get paid directly into your Inter&Co digital account.  \r\n\r\nExplore cashback offers and deals with gift cards from a range of top brands. Sign up for the Inter&Co LOOP rewards program and start earning points that can be exchanged for gift cards and more.   \r\n\r\nDownload the Inter&Co super app today.  \r\n\r\nINTER & CO PAYMENTS INC,., doing business as Inter&Co (\u201cINTER&CO\u201d), a regulated entity, authorized to operate under the laws and regulations of the United States of America (USA), is responsible for offering, in partnerships with other financial institutions, the Inter&Co Account and providing the related services. INTER & CO PAYMENTS INC., is not a bank. The debit card associated with your Inter&Co Account is a debit card issued by American Bank, Member FDIC, pursuant to a license from Mastercard\u00ae. See your applicable card holder agreement for details. The Inter&Co Account deposits are held by Community Federal Savings Bank (\u201cPartner Bank\u201d), a Federal Deposit Insurance Corporation (\u201cFDIC\u201d) member. If you have any questions or concerns regarding any transaction, please contact us at help@inter.co or by calling us at 1-888-305-7264",
    "descriptionHTML": "Your new financial super app is here. Download the Inter&amp;Co super app and open your zero-fee digital account today. Take control of your finances the modern way.  <br><br>Get access to a range of services and benefits directly on your app. Send money abroad to over 60 countries. Invest in stocks and ETFs from as little as $5. Deposit your checks and get paid directly into your Inter&amp;Co digital account.  <br><br>Explore cashback offers and deals with gift cards from a range of top brands. Sign up for the Inter&amp;Co LOOP rewards program and start earning points that can be exchanged for gift cards and more.   <br><br>Download the Inter&amp;Co super app today.  <br><br>INTER &amp; CO PAYMENTS INC,., doing business as Inter&amp;Co (\u201cINTER&amp;CO\u201d), a regulated entity, authorized to operate under the laws and regulations of the United States of America (USA), is responsible for offering, in partnerships with other financial institutions, the Inter&amp;Co Account and providing the related services. INTER &amp; CO PAYMENTS INC., is not a bank. The debit card associated with your Inter&amp;Co Account is a debit card issued by American Bank, Member FDIC, pursuant to a license from Mastercard\u00ae. See your applicable card holder agreement for details. The Inter&amp;Co Account deposits are held by Community Federal Savings Bank (\u201cPartner Bank\u201d), a Federal Deposit Insurance Corporation (\u201cFDIC\u201d) member. If you have any questions or concerns regarding any transaction, please contact us at help@inter.co or by calling us at 1-888-305-7264",
